abstract: >-
  Governance core and experiment code for the FinTrust paper. FinTrust sits between several
  probabilistic forecasters and a trading decision: it scores each forecaster on matured outcomes,
  moves it through an explicit lifecycle (shadow, active, probation, quarantine) and records every
  decision in a hash-chained audit log. The repository regenerates every table and figure of the paper
  from saved model outputs, and the forecasts themselves from public data.
